{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02769",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 2.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Right then, come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.56,
      "end_seconds": 6.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Ah, good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 7.47,
      "end_seconds": 11.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Doctor, uh, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.46,
      "end_seconds": 20.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.18,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. Is this your first time with this clinic?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.18,
      "end_seconds": 26.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Mm, first time with this one, yes. A friend recommended it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.67,
      "end_seconds": 30.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 31.08,
      "end_seconds": 34.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "We came because of hot flushes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.96,
      "end_seconds": 41.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.75,
      "end_seconds": 48.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Hmm, it's been going on for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.76,
      "end_seconds": 58.56,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.23,
      "end_seconds": 79.47,
      "duration_seconds": 19.24,
      "text": "I'd say mild. It happens all the time. I've had periods becoming irregular too, for about a month. About periods becoming irregular, mostly severe. I've also had poor sleep, since yesterday. About poor sleep, it feels moderate to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.13,
      "end_seconds": 86.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "So, did you get pelvic pain, weight loss or bleeding after sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.63,
      "end_seconds": 92.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "No, no pelvic pain, weight loss or bleeding after sex."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.38,
      "end_seconds": 97.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Has there been any very heavy bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.44,
      "end_seconds": 103.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "No, none, no very heavy bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.91,
      "end_seconds": 111.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.37,
      "end_seconds": 113.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.19,
      "end_seconds": 117.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.96,
      "end_seconds": 121.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.17,
      "end_seconds": 136.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Okay, which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.3,
      "end_seconds": 152.92,
      "duration_seconds": 14.62,
      "text": "I'm on metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my heart. Let me think, I'm on paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 154.25,
      "end_seconds": 163.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the paracetamol was 1300 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.64,
      "end_seconds": 168.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.33,
      "end_seconds": 173.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "No, you know, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.62,
      "end_seconds": 179.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.69,
      "end_seconds": 194.08,
      "duration_seconds": 11.39,
      "text": "Oh, I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.49,
      "end_seconds": 206.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Right, any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.48,
      "end_seconds": 212.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Just my septum straightened, in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.93,
      "end_seconds": 215.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.44,
      "end_seconds": 220.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "I've got heart failure. Yes, arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.81,
      "end_seconds": 223.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.37,
      "end_seconds": 234.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.11,
      "end_seconds": 238.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.64,
      "end_seconds": 243.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.26,
      "end_seconds": 247.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.09,
      "end_seconds": 251.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.68,
      "end_seconds": 256.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.05,
      "end_seconds": 268.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.66,
      "end_seconds": 300.89,
      "duration_seconds": 15.23,
      "text": "Okay: height 155 centimetres, pulse is 69 beats a minute, SpO2 97 percent on room air, weight 56 kilos, BMI works out to 23.3, BP is 122 over 72, temperature is 36.8 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.75,
      "end_seconds": 305.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.37,
      "end_seconds": 309.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Alright, that's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.19,
      "end_seconds": 317.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.66,
      "end_seconds": 321.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.23,
      "end_seconds": 332.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and the abdomen is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.67,
      "end_seconds": 339.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.35,
      "end_seconds": 367.03,
      "duration_seconds": 14.68,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I'd lean towards perimenopause. I can't rule out a thyroid problem yet. What I'm giving you is estradiol gel, 1 pump, once a day, long term. That's for menopausal symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.97,
      "end_seconds": 369.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.19,
      "end_seconds": 379.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.55,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.46,
      "end_seconds": 393.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "Right, that's fine by me. Let me think, could I get a blood count done? A friend had it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.52,
      "end_seconds": 408.95,
      "duration_seconds": 13.43,
      "text": "Not right now, it wouldn't change what we do today. Let's review you in three months. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.43,
      "end_seconds": 419.95,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "So, I take the estradiol gel, 1 pump, once a day and come back in three months. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.99,
      "end_seconds": 427.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.16,
      "end_seconds": 433.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "I mean, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.9,
      "end_seconds": 436.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}